[0.35,"o","INFO: Half-duplex: Hold play/pause to request the FIFO floor; release to cancel or relinquish. Double beep confirms a ready route.\r\n"]
[0.2,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2Jbt-intercom | half-duplex | 0 owned active links\r\nHEADSET NAME      ADDRESS             CONNECTED  DUPLEX  TX/RX  TX / FLOOR       BATTERY  SIGNAL\r\nAlex             AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:01  yes        yes      0/0   idle            80%      -58 dBm (strong)\r\nJules            AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02  yes        yes      0/0   idle            55%      -66 dBm (good)\r\nMorgan           AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:03  yes        yes      0/0   idle            90%      -71 dBm (good)\r\n\r\nTX / FLOOR is per headset; links represent routing, not measured speech. RSSI and battery are shown only if BlueZ reports them.\r\n"]
[3.0,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2Jbt-intercom | half-duplex | 2 owned active links\r\nHEADSET NAME      ADDRESS             CONNECTED  DUPLEX  TX/RX  TX / FLOOR       BATTERY  SIGNAL\r\nAlex             AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:01  yes        yes      1/0   has floor       80%      -58 dBm (strong)\r\nJules            AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02  yes        yes      0/1   idle            55%      -66 dBm (good)\r\nMorgan           AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:03  yes        yes      0/1   idle            90%      -71 dBm (good)\r\n\r\nTX / FLOOR is per headset; links represent routing, not measured speech. RSSI and battery are shown only if BlueZ reports them.\r\n"]
